Track 1: The Mainsheet Snaps
- Story & Context: Old Silas was monitoring the transmission wires near the harbor when a rogue bolt of lightning fused his banjo strings into a permanent, ringing dissonance. He felt the static burn his palms as he frantically tried to play, creating the first note of our secret anthem. "Hold the current steady before the harbor light dies."
